 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Morphosyntactic regime of privative constructions",
     "texto": [
      "1. **ohne dass (+ subordinate clause)**: when the main action and the omitted circumstance are carried out by different actors or entities, subordination with «ohne dass» is obligatory: **Das Parlament verabschiedete das Gesetz, ohne dass die Opposition zustimmte** (the parliament passed the law without the opposition giving its approval).",
      "2. **ohne … zu (+ infinitive)**: reserved exclusively for co-reference of subject (identical subject): **Die Ministerin reiste ab, ohne den Bericht zu unterzeichnen** (the minister left without signing the report).",
      "3. Trying to use an infinitive with a different subject constitutes a serious error at B2.2 registers."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Type of subject",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Required structure",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Legislative example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "Different subjects",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       {
        "texto": "ohne dass + Subjekt 2 + ... + finites Verb",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Die Frist verstrich, ohne dass die Behörde reagierte.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
